{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_susuro_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_susuro_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"專業醫師","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_susuro_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"b3ae8c7a94ccea1ba0b74946b0d8005dafd273aa7b87cf90c0036b5fb6e2823f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在萊塔尼亞辦事處要求緊急支援的申請下，蘇蘇洛帶領羅德島醫療團隊前往現場支援。怪物襲擊、感染者，傷患......災難已經發生。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"幾點了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"四點，你都問了幾遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我急啊！你不急嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜點。急有什麼用啊，他們從本艦趕過來的，能平安到達都謝天謝地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，三天怎麼從本艦趕過來？有點厲害啊，本艦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒去過羅德島本艦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"沒去過，這一趟車費可不便宜，再說還有一堆事情要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"本艦有一種大型浮空交通工具，移動速度特別快，沒見過吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"浮空的？車？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那肯定不是車......具體的我也叫不上來名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦，是高塔的術師老爺們用的那種高級貨，天上飄的那種？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是那個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀你別猜了，我見得不多，也講不太清，回頭看到就懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼閒，再檢查一下車，回去的時間可就很緊了，別出差錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"行行行......你是老大，你說了算。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，這次本艦來的是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你都沒去過本艦，說了名字你也不認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這邊遞交的是緊急申請，無論來的是誰，肯定是醫療部門的精銳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"這次事情可不小啊，這來的得是什麼樣的精銳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這你就別操心了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，他們來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"這載具......有點厲害啊，本艦還有這種東西，長見識了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，準備接人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎來到萊塔尼亞，我是本地辦事處的負責人菲勒加斯，叫我菲勒就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我是本艦醫療幹員蘇蘇洛，這幾位是我的助手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你愣著幹什麼，打個招呼啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！哦！對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我是辦事處的......司機......不對，我是本地辦事處的幹員，代號活塞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"情況很複雜，我們時間緊急，各位先上車吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"關於這次突發事件的詳細情況，我們列印了全套資料，就先在車上看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，麻煩您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還攜帶了一些設備，也麻煩您搬到車上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩個小時後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看第二份文件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你檢查一下這份報告，確定一下有沒有需要額外準備的器材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（喂！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，說話鬼鬼祟祟的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"你小聲點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"不是說派來的都是精銳嗎，怎麼領隊的是這麼個小姑娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你小子說話注意點，小心我扣你獎金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼時候養成的以貌取人的爛毛病？員工手冊白看了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"不懂就管住嘴，這位是真的本艦醫療部門精銳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好......我的錯，我的錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲勒先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文件我看完了，我有幾個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據描述，這次險情中大部分需要醫療救助的人都不是礦石病感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，雖然萊塔尼亞官方通報的說法是天災導致城市破壞與傷亡，但是實際情況比這要複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是天災信使的工作失誤嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"目前來看......並不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這次針對天災的撤離行動本來是沒有任何問題的，至少從流程上沒有遇到任何問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"唯一的問題是......誰都沒想到天災颶風的路徑下有至少十片針蚤的大型巢穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那個村子雖然提前開始了移動，但是上百隻逃離天災的針蚤直接衝到了遷徙的隊伍裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"針蚤？就是那種一米多長的食肉蟲子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"上百隻？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前有傷亡數字嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞官方信源還沒有給出明確的數字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"已經兩天了，還沒有得出結論......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說明傷亡人數暫時無法統計。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"領地衛兵把很多傷者送到了附近的城鎮，我們還沒來得及一一查看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辦事處儲備的醫療物資還充足嗎？處理針蚤毒素的解毒劑儲量呢？手術設備保養狀況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當地其他醫療救護隊的調動情況呢？我需要這些文件上沒有收錄的資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療物資方面，暫且還算充沛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"本地的掌權者第一時間就開始了救援工作，羅德島辦事處在接到委託之後也得到了充足的應急救難物資補給。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療設備狀況都不錯，但它們不會自己動起來，我們的人手嚴重不足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮子裡的醫生算得上訓練有素，但缺乏緊急情況下的應對經驗，很多人一輩子沒見過這種大災大難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"辦事處駐紮的城鎮人口不多，因此，全鎮加起來也只有三個小診所，能做手術的醫生就更少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"很多傷患沒能撐到手術台上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"辦事處現在容納了很多難民，情況非常不樂觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，在這樣混亂的情況下，我們無法第一時間對人群進行區分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"送來的病人裡是有感染者的......而感染者逝世之後的情況......你明白我的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一段路程，你們先休息一下吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstrongpoint"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我們到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊已經有不少人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"傷患應該都轉移到辦事處附近了，辦事處的其他工作人員應該正在處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"活塞你在這裡等著，一會兒會有其他網站的補給車過來，你在這裡接應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我在這裡乾等著？合適嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你第一次參加這種任務，現場情況比你想的要殘酷得多，老老實實在這裡接收和分派醫療物資吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"開玩笑，那幾個小姑娘都能去，我一個大老爺們怕什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......臭小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"行，沒問題，回頭可別說我沒提醒你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目全非的傷患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"水......給我水......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸！爸爸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血肉模糊的傷患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"過來一個人！這個感染者快不行了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通傷患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染者！別，別過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼在這？快回到收治區去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"衛兵！衛兵！人呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的媽啊......這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這比我想的還要慘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我前天來的時候，那邊的大院子還是本地商會的貨運站，現在已經被徵用作為普通病患的收治區了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生人手太過有限，只有傷勢最重的人能優先在醫療室得到搶救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些躺在地上的人......是什麼情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這些應該都是感染者，這座鎮子比較小，沒有感染者收容區，他們不能把感染者和普通人安置在一個地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不能把他們就這麼丟在廣場上，菲勒幹員，辦事處的倉庫能騰出多少空間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在就安排把東西全搬出來，問題不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還需要一個單獨的空間容納傷重的感染者，最好是能單獨隔開......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只能把員工宿舍空出來了，這需要一點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交給您了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一組去庫房，檢查感染者的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二組，三組和我來，把設備都搬到手術室裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對傷患的分類和對應的安置就麻煩您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我也來幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，你來搭把手，幫我把這幾個人抬到屋裡去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"使用源石技藝加速傷口癒合之前，一定要確定毒素已經清理乾淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果傷口不嚴重，就盡可能不要動用源石技藝，醫生的體力是現在最寶貴的資源，合理調配才能保住更多性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先處理這一床！這裡有個危急病人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（倒抽一口涼氣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他為了保護家裡人，被針蚤咬掉了胳膊，送過來的時候已經失去意識了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是感染者，不過病情還穩定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他的手呢？殘肢還留著嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（搖了搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"創面已經細菌感染了，左手也有肉眼可見的大面積潰爛，可能還得截掉一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這樣豈不是兩隻手都要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去幫二組吧，這邊交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦您了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要愣著，準備感染者應急處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"患者的體表結晶在咽喉處，檢查一下血液。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意他腕部的鱗片，準備薩弗拉專用的手術刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屋子裡的燈還是太暗了，活塞先生，確認一下發電機的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三個小時後\n辦事處醫療室內，重症傷患的手術依然沒有停止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傷患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"醫生......我是不是沒救了......醫生，你告訴我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"腔內出血較多，給血液吸引器換個瓶子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傷患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"求求你......求求你醫生，把這個戒指......帶給我妻子，求求你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會活下來的，堅持住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紗布用完了，再拿一點過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傷患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別......別騙我，我知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要說話！你會活下來的，我保證！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫忙按住這裡，我來縫合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"雙氧水也用完了，誰去倉庫拿一箱過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活塞先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好！我，我馬上去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血止住了，剩下的交給你，我去看一下其他床。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡！隊長！剛送過來一個，快不行了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奄奄一息的傷患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胸腹聯合傷，腹部開放性外傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進去，優先處理，先切開他的食道與氣管！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......天哪......天哪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要停下來！還有其他病人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"檢查一下有沒有臟器破損！看看有沒有腹膜後的出血點！快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......我有點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......我......我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，辛苦了。你先去外面休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝......謝謝......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......太可怕了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔............"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......本艦的人，平時都要面對這種局面嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃......又來......嘔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......還好，還好，我只是不太習慣這種......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"給，毛巾，擦把臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃嘔......有點丟人。沒想到我是現場裡第一個堅持不住的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，你表現得還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣算是還不錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你自告奮勇跑去幫忙，堅持了半天，你也不是專業的醫療幹員，我本來預計你半個小時就扛不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"那個小姑娘......不，那位醫療幹員，還真是厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我之前怎麼給你說的。他們是本艦的精銳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這位叫蘇蘇洛的醫療幹員，是幾年前帕勒莫事件的親歷者，不要小看她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"帕勒莫事件？啊......就是當年那個轟動敘拉古的事件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"是源石礦廠爆炸那次？我記得有很多平民急性感染，同時醫療準備不足導致急性感染者大量死亡......好像有半個城區瀕臨崩潰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那才是真正的人間地獄。想像一下，大量感染者急性發作，遍地都是已經開始崩解的感染者遺骸，漫天都是活性粉塵的恐怖景象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"帕勒莫事件的很多親歷者都留下了嚴重的精神創傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"對這位醫療幹員來說，今天的場面根本不算什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我還是進去幫忙吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你消停會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"一會兒你又吐在裡面，反而給她們添麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼想幫忙，就去安置區看看有沒有溝通工作，順帶也檢查一下其他辦事處的補給車有沒有來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，我這就去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，臭小子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......要命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，醫生，怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這次實在是多虧了你們，大部分傷患的情況現在都穩定了，接下來就看領主那邊怎麼做後續安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以前還覺得你們根本就不是醫療公司，實在是......真的是......不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你們，我感謝你們，我......我一時找不到更好的詞，要不是你們的救援，傷亡人數和伴生災害簡直不可想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我只是個打雜......額......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療幹員呢？他們休息了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地醫生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也不太清楚他們去哪了，我還以為你們羅德島的人會更清楚呢，我看你們的宿舍都拿來安置傷患了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......知道了，你先早些休息吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，本部來的醫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，你小點聲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼事，出去說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......算了，讓他們歇著吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"安置區怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼問題，領主的人都到了，他們已經轉移了第一批輕症傷患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"順利就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼想說的就直接說，別吞吞吐吐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼......只是覺得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"想辭職了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"沒，只是對羅德島的這份工作加深了一點認識......大概吧，一點點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"有幹勁是好事啊，既然你還有幹勁，那現在就去清點一下醫療物資的消耗情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"做兩份記錄，一份給辦事處留檔，一份明早遞交給本地政府。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，我這就去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"四天後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"東西都收拾好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"來了來了來了，差一點沒趕上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你幹什麼去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這不是蘇蘇洛小姐讓我幫忙買東西嗎，我都買來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......這些是給凱爾希醫生的書，這個是給嘉維爾醫生的工藝品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼，零食？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個是給博士的......小禮物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？就是......那個博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，替我向凱爾希醫生和博士問好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"最後祝你們一路順風，安全抵達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您，我們下次再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"他們走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，回去幹活吧，還有一大堆報告要寫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是也該找個工作機會去羅德島本艦看看呢......感覺都是些很奇妙的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊，但是，先把自己手上的事情幹完再琢磨吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["菲勒加斯","辦事處幹員B"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]}]}
